#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:8
msgid ""
"Portal UI is designed along **three orthogonal dimensions**. Visual "
"foundations, components, and interaction patterns all adapt through this "
"lens. Phone size does **not** imply compact layout; Tauri does **not** imply "
"touch."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:10
msgid ""
"Agent API tables and hard bans → [`.agent/rules/ui-dimensions.md`]"
"(../../.agent/rules/ui-dimensions.md). Implementation entry points are "
"listed there; this page is the product narrative."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:17
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Capability        | Description                                                                                            |\n"
#| "| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
#| "| `memory_recall`   | Four sources: semantic / conversation / limbic / autobiographical; Top N; conversation returns snippet |\n"
#| "| `sessions_search` | Session message search; returns snippet (not full content)                                             |\n"
