#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:19
msgid ""
"Do not call app frame “Shell”. Do not derive rail vs bottom tabs from Shell "
"kind."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "The three dimensions"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:27
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Attribute  | Value                                                                                                                                                 |\n"
#| "| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| Trigger    | Sleep-cycle step `deep-sleep` (after light-sleep in DAG)                                                                                              |\n"
#| "| Target     | All active semantic memory                                                                                                                            |\n"
#| "| Operations | Contradiction detection + expiry marking, split, dedup merge, pin quality review—four sequential rounds                                               |\n"
#| "| Mode       | **Incremental** (scheduled Tue–Sun): skip quiet rounds when nothing was `updated` in 24h; **Full** (scheduled Mon + manual): all rounds on full store |\n"
msgid ""
"| Dimension       | Controls                                     | Values                          | How decided                                              | Stability                              |\n"
"| --------------- | -------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Shell**       | Capabilities (native APIs, files, push, IPC) | `web` / `tauri` (+ buildTarget) | Build + runtime (`getShellKind` / `getShellBuildTarget`) | Fixed per install                      |\n"
"| **Layout**      | Presentation (wide/narrow chrome, nav IA)    | `compact` / `expanded`          | CSS `matchMedia` (viewport)                              | Changes with window size               |\n"
"| **Interaction** | Input paradigm                               | `touch` / `pointer`             | `primaryInput` → `(pointer: fine)` + `(hover: hover)`    | Usually stable; can follow peripherals |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 属性  | 值                                                                                                |\n"
"| ---------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 触发    | sleep-cycle 步骤 `deep-sleep`（DAG 中在 light-sleep 之后）                                             |\n"
"| 目标     | 全部 active 语义记忆                                                                           |\n"
"| 操作 | 矛盾检测 + 过期标记、拆分、去重合并、置顶维护——四轮顺序执行 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:29
msgid ""
"Colloquial “mobile layout / desktop layout” means `compact` / `expanded` — "
"not phone shell / desktop shell."
msgstr ""

