#. type: Title ###
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shell → capabilities (`portal-sdk`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:42
msgid ""
"Use for: file/FS bridges, notifications, Habitat settings visibility, hash "
"navigation quirks, keyboard inset / safe-area host differences."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:44
msgid ""
"Do **not** use Shell kind to lock main nav (rail vs tabs), hover "
"affordances, or Enter-to-send."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:46
msgid "Unsupported capabilities return `null` / `false`; UI degrades."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Layout → app frame and page structure"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:50
msgid ""
"Use for: compact bottom nav + drawer vs expanded rail + multi-column; Dialog "
"vs Sheet **presentation**; list-detail stacking; settings chrome (tabs vs "
"sidebar via `detectSettingsChromePlatform()`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:52
msgid "Common layout patterns:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:57
msgid ""
"**List-Detail** — side-by-side when expanded; stack + route when compact "
"(`ListDetailLayout`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:57
msgid "**Grid-List** — multi-column vs single column"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:57
msgid ""
"**Modal-Sheet** — centered Dialog when expanded; bottom Sheet when compact "
"(presentation = layout; gesture = interaction)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:57
msgid ""
"**Sidebar-Drawer** — fixed sidebar vs hamburger + drawer; compact viewport-"
"fixed layers must clear `--app-bottom-nav-h`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:59
msgid ""
"Settings **section fields** may follow shell "
"(`resolveSettingsContentPlatform()`); settings **chrome** follows layout."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Interaction → input paradigm"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/dimensions.md:63
msgid ""
"Use for: ContextMenu vs ActionSheet / long-press; hover-revealed actions; "
"Enter send vs newline; minimum hit targets."
msgstr ""

